# Local reasoning lane: DeepSeek-R1 distill (Qwen2.5 14B base, ~9GB).
# Router sends algorithm / maths / logic prompts here, and hard prompts when
# hosted Claude is unavailable. R1 always emits a reasoning trace, so leave
# room in num_predict. DeepSeek recommends temperature 0.5–0.7 and no system
# prompt (Claude Code supplies its own).
FROM deepseek-r1:14b
PARAMETER num_ctx 24576
PARAMETER num_predict 8192
PARAMETER temperature 0.6
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
